        "en": "Cat owners across Birmingham express profound trust and appreciation for the sitters, frequently describing them as reliable, warm, and conscientious. Clients emphasize that sitters go above and beyond, treating clients' homes with utmost respect and handling challenging situations with immense empathy. Many owners consider the team indispensable."
