      "title": {
        "en": "Loving care and medical support"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers highlight the exceptional attention provided to cats of all ages, including elderly felines needing daily medication, injections, and specialized diets. Clients appreciate that sitters dedicate time to playing, brushing, and cuddling pets during every visit. Owners frequently note returning home to find relaxed and happy companions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 24,
      "title": {
        "en": "Reassuring daily updates and photos"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise the detailed reports, photographs, and video clips sent via messaging apps after every home visit. Reviewers note that these regular updates provide enormous peace of mind while travelling for holidays or work. Clients cherish the personalized commentaries detailing their pets' daily activities and moods."
      }
    }
